&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Models that don&#39;t set a &lt;code&gt;repeat_penalty&lt;/code&gt; now default to 1.0 (off) instead of 1.1, matching other engines and speeding up speculative decoding; set a per-model parameter if an older model repeats itself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faster prefill on NVFP4 MLX models with a global scale, about 7–8% on Qwen3.6 and Muse Glimmer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed blob verification being skipped when an OCI manifest&#39;s config and layer share a digest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
