rcard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/42406&quot;&gt;#42406&lt;/a&gt;), multimodal-prefix bidirectional attention (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4761265985&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46942&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46942/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46942&quot;&gt;#46942&lt;/a&gt;), and dynamic speculative decoding compatible with full CUDA graphs (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4686202847&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45953&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45953/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45953&quot;&gt;#45953&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
