&lt;li&gt;W4A4 MegaMoE kernels — faster speed with negligible accuracy drop: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4426845156&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25052&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25052/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25052&quot;&gt;#25052&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
